OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain or drizzle this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight, although coastal areas
OL,8,Fturning drier by Tuesday morning. A
OL,9,Flight southeasterly breeze for most,
OL,10,Fturning increasingly windy along the
OL,11,Fcoast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FCloudy and wet morning across
OL,14,Fwestern parts, with drier conditions
OL,15,Felsewhere. The rain clears for a time
OL,16,Fbefore moving in once more during the
OL,17,Fafternoon. Staying breezy along the
OL,18,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
