OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fperiods with patchy rain Wednesday
OL,7,Fmorning, followed by outbreaks of
OL,8,Fheavy rain. Dry with sunny spells and
OL,9,Flight winds Thursday. Heavy and
OL,10,Fpersistent rain, with strong winds on
OL,11,FFriday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
